servers.chatHint:
chat models pi's llama.cpp provider can read as classifiers: {models}
pi reads them from a llama-server router (started without a model) once a model is loaded: /llama in pi, or curl -s {origin}/models/load -d '{"model":"<model>"}'
to use one: export LLAMA_BASE_URL={origin} (or /login llama.cpp in pi), add a classifier "llama.cpp/<model>", set classification.temperature to 2, and test it with /tier eval
